dogecoin.text:
@KyleMacLeanX BTC extended a weak run on Sunday, falling to $43,874, its lowest level since February.
It rose to $45,200 as of 11:38 a.m. Monday in Tokyo, but is still about $20,000 below the record set in April.
Other cryptocurrencies such as Ethereum and Dogecoin are also under pressure.

